sides":"Each executed generation rewrites all files in its dedicated output directory and fails if any cannot be removed; up-to-date task skipping is unchanged.","findings":["review:5465138629","inline:4226135407"],"length":616,"offset":0,"sha256":"c88d9b9a782b98520e5b5a734006541bea3a2fa6efe2085c595cece4e9073568","summary":"Clear stale JFlex sources before regeneration","upsides":"Incremental regeneration removes obsolete classes, produces only the current sanitizer, and remains compatible with Gradle configuration-cache reuse."}],"findings":[{"analysis":"Read the full overview and expanded details. Its one open finding duplicates the inline stale-generation defect, not an additional API or telemetry defect. The shared cleanup patch addresses it; seeded obsolete sources are removed, generation and compilation succeed, and 291 focused SQL tests pass.","disposition":"fixed","downsides":"Executed generation must delete and rewrite its task-owned output; resulting target CI remains separate from these local checks.","key":"review:5465138629","upsides":"Addresses the review-body recommendation together with its inline finding without unrelated API changes."},{"analysis":"At frozen build.gradle.kts lines 43-51, mkdirs and JFlex --nobak do not remove obsolete generated files. The source set includes the whole output directory and SqlQuery no longer defines createWithSummary. Checked recursive deletion now precedes generation. Tests with the obsolete factory-calling source and a nested stale file verify removal, current sanitizer creation, successful compilation, and configuration-cache reuse.","disposition":"fixed","downsides":"Regeneration performs a recursive deletion limited to the dedicated JFlex output directory.","key":"inline:4226135407","upsides":"Prevents incremental-checkout compilation failures and explicitly reports cleanup failures instead of compiling stale sources."}],"input_identity":{},"outcome":"fixes","request_digest":"971fa401756788e6f6a1758b2b431d885887e72bcf61a05ad3108fcc8bbb47ec","schema":2},"download_sha256":"2624b1e4d0b9b22464e6eb40ad5eb2319d9840f7d493963fca5406e0f773a703","frozen_sha":"768b211e0d6cb6640e9395967d7be2c7aa7a5616","pr":20453,"publication_eligible":false,"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","request_digest":"971fa401756788e6f6a1758b2b431d885887e72bcf61a05ad3108fcc8bbb47ec","request_id":"742682829a30409d8433164a8c6654eb","run_attempt":1,"run_id":37888008754,"schema":2,"scope":"Structural/Git verification only. No target code or tests are executed.","server_artifact_digest":"sha256:2624b1e4d0b9b22464e6eb40ad5eb2319d9840f7d493963fca5406e0f773a703","verification":"verified","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":37889656597},"workflow_revision":"9dd7e361f1696014cd75259f5019d3340edaed26"},"request":{"authorized_actor_id":218610,"baseline_review_ids":[5461521421,5461522373,5461547710,5464981197,5464983442,5465138629],"budgets":{"max_iterations":5,"propagation_seconds":120,"retention_days":14,"worker_timeout_minutes":30},"commit_author":{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"findings":[{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nJFlex generation must remove the obsolete generated source on incremental builds.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>1 open finding</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.png\" alt=\"High severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Clear stale JFlex-generated files before regeneration](#discussion_r4226135407) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nCompletes the 3.0 SQL query API and parser cleanup while preserving Couchbase telemetry behavior.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Replaces `createWithSummary` with a five-argument `create` factory.\n- Renames the JFlex-generated sanitizer and updates callers.\n- Adds factory, telemetry, parsing, and cache-lifecycle regression coverage.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `CHANGELOG.md` | Documents the breaking factory migration. |\r\n| `instrumentation-api-incubator/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts` | Updates JFlex generation for the renamed sanitizer. |\r\n| `instrumentation-api-incubator/\u200bsrc/\u200bmain/\u200bjflex/\u200bSqlSanitizer.jflex` | Renames the generated parser and factory calls. |\r\n| `instrumentation-api-incubator/\u200b.../\u200bSqlQuery.java` | Adds the full factory and restores public accessors. |\r\n| `instrumentation-api-incubator/\u200b.../\u200bSqlQueryAnalyzer.java` | Uses the renamed parser and factory. |\r\n| `instrumentation-api-incubator/\u200b.../\u200bSqlClientAttributesExtractor.java` | Removes obsolete deprecation suppression. |\r\n| `instrumentation-api-incubator/\u200b.../\u200bMultiQuery.java` | Removes obsolete suppression and comments. |\r\n| `instrumentation-api-incubator/\u200b.../\u200bDbClientSpanNameExtractor.java` | Removes obsolete deprecation suppression. |\r\n| `instrumentation-api-incubator/\u200b.../\u200bSqlQueryTest.java` | Tests factory semantics and truncation. |\r\n| `instrumentation-api-incubator/\u200b.../\u200bSqlQueryAnalyzerUtilCacheTest.java` | Renames and expands cache lifecycle tests. |\r\n| `instrumentation-api-incubator/\u200b.../\u200bSqlQueryAnalyzerTest.java` | Updates sanitizer and factory references. |\r\n| `instrumentation-api-incubator/\u200b.../\u200bSqlClientAttributesExtractorTest.java` | Tests operation and collection extraction. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200bcouchbase/\u200b.../\u200bCouchbaseRequestInfo.java` | Removes obsolete accessor suppression. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200bcouchbase/\u200b.../\u200bCouchbaseAttributesGetterTest.java` | Verifies copied-request telemetry. |\r\n| `instrumentation/\u200bcouchbase/\u200b.../\u200bCouchbaseQuerySanitizerTest.java` | Removes obsolete test suppression. |\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n---\n\n\ud83d\udca1 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5465138629","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5465138629},{"body":"[General] Renaming the JFlex input/class does not remove previously generated files from this output directory. On an incremental checkout, `AutoSqlSanitizerWithSummary.java` remains in the source set and still calls the removed `createWithSummary` methods, causing compilation to fail. Clear the generated directory before invoking JFlex.","comment_commit_id":"768b211e0d6cb6640e9395967d7be2c7aa7a5616","comment_id":4226135407,"key":"inline:4226135407","kind":"inline","line":47,"original_commit_id":"768b211e0d6cb6640e9395967d7be2c7aa7a5616","original_line":47,"path":"instrumentation-api-incubator/build.gradle.kts","review_commit_id":"768b211e0d6cb6640e9395967d7be2c7aa7a5616","review_id":5465138629,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-09T02:45:20Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"e8389efad92a5a26a513fb0798c1ce69c925c34360a02891b320daff37fcb4ca","id":4226135407,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-09T02:45:20Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT